+/* There is no V_EL/V_ER/V_STEPL/V_STEPR/V_NC/V_CNT, no V_HSL and no V_SAREA.
+ * The two edges live in %ebx/%esi and the colour in %ebp for the whole walk,
+ * the steps and the row count are macro arguments naming V_SXAB/V_SXAC/... in
+ * place, and sarea is consumed by cvtsi2sd the instruction after it is formed.
+ * The generic slots they replace cost 38 instructions of stack-to-stack copy
+ * per triangle -- see the SEGMENT comment. */
 
